# Data files must survive a round trip byte-for-byte. The synthetic corpora
# contain article text with newlines inside quoted CSV fields, and these are the
# exact files the reported results were computed from -- letting git rewrite
# their line endings per-platform would mean a clone on another OS no longer
# holds the same bytes that produced those numbers.
*.csv -text
*.json -text

# Everything else follows the normal per-platform convention.
* text=auto
